### @name="Book a Vehicle"
POST  http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Accept: text/plain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
      "email": "roger@adobe.com"
  },
  "vehicle": {
    "registrationNumber": "DH-10-AA-0434"
  },
  "dateFrom": "2025-08-20"
}



### @name="Return a Vehicle"
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2?returnDate=21-08-2025
Accept: text/plain

### @name="GET all Bookings/Rentals"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Accept: application/json